Our cosy lounge is perfect for smaller gatherings, intimate meetings, or quiet study sessions.

The room offers approximately 49 m² of floor space (8.4m × 5.8m), not including the built-in benches and bar area. It seats around 30 comfortably — and if you need a few extra chairs, they can often be borrowed from the adjoining Studio when it's free.

Please see the booking system below for current pricing and availability.

